        <p>If you have any questions regarding this privacy policy or the technical implementation of our apps, please
            contact us at:</p>
        <p><strong>Lemon Slice Labs</strong></p>
        <p>Operated by lemon slice digital GmbH, Germany</p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@lemonslice.de">hello@lemonslice.de</a></p>
        <p>Website: <a href="/">https://www.lemonslice.de/</a></p>
    </div>
